# Monthly Sales Trends and Regional Analysis Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project is an interactive Sales Analysis Dashboard developed using Microsoft Excel. The dashboard analyzes monthly sales trends, regional performance, and product-wise sales insights through dynamic visualizations, KPI cards, and slicers.

The main objective of this project is to identify business sales patterns over time and help in data-driven decision-making using Excel analytics tools.

---

## Features
- Interactive Dashboard Design
- KPI Cards for:
  - Total Sales
  - Best Performing Month
  - Worst Performing Month
  - Top Performing Region
- Monthly Sales Trend Line Chart
- Region-wise Sales Comparison Bar Chart
- Interactive Slicers for:
  - Product
  - Region
  - Month
- Dynamic Pivot Tables and Pivot Charts
- Key Insights Section for Business Understanding

---

## Tools & Technologies Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Slicers
- Data Cleaning & Formatting
- Dashboard Designing

---

## Key Insights
- Total sales reached ₹40,84,586 across all regions.
- August 2024 was the best-performing month with the highest sales growth.
- July 2024 recorded the lowest sales among all months.
- South region generated the highest revenue compared to other regions.
- Sales showed a consistent upward growth trend over time.
- Interactive slicers allow dynamic filtering and analysis.

